{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":865264,\"title\":\"It Started with Swap Shop\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Noel Edmonds, Keith Chegwin, John Craven and Maggie Philbin reunite for a one-off edition of the Saturday morning classic Swap Shop to celebrate its 30th anniversary.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i5AVVmY1kW7lo8giDWhJZ0Vw48w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gHgSVFgWxK0GZVskrVQtG8l94Dm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":129,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Richard Valentine\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":100512,\"name\":\"Richard Valentine\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k31NrrvofE0LxtTSvae4nIKzp5P.jpg\"},{\"id\":1220454,\"name\":\"Noel Edmonds\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Noqcj0PhRTJNXamw2gQO75yVz0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1220616,\"name\":\"John Craven\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q91hYa1vhFjCZRugFg77wLOuqkz.jpg\"},{\"id\":601497,\"name\":\"Keith Chegwin\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vOCoJl0AB9blFLkf8xQqTGS4kR8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1232710,\"name\":\"Maggie Philbin\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l6cbxwwRXWbOEiV4NODO2tUwCSa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1225258,\"name\":\"Johnny Ball\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aafCMtmFr0ZgLBuj1DirXcJf5JL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1221224,\"name\":\"Nicki Chapman\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8edtnOb9uJAQuoWbQwy0PcQ75pr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1216060,\"name\":\"Fearne Cotton\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mZA4265GHxEyTnQjvoHLnqDPt4M.jpg\"},{\"id\":19610,\"name\":\"Michael Crawford\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pJAKSlgawo9Sr3Ykiljju3QE5Zj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1216380,\"name\":\"Emma Forbes\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6V3cBRFgB1jNWc9a2Y7ufxQjoOL.jpg\"},{\"id\":137023,\"name\":\"Sarah Greene\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bGKwB6SxUAutdUmSYDu8y6HmWzu.jpg\"},{\"id\":53519,\"name\":\"Lenny Henry\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aT5zYMfGI3x4sGtCs9QM4gT0G2h.jpg\"},{\"id\":3211209,\"name\":\"Simon Hickson\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5LLLCCYgyajsMsN1E2bqGtvsOeh.jpg\"},{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Barry Humphries\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gtOAbs8ZFJiDDRPPock1qmP4V18.jpg\"},{\"id\":1215956,\"name\":\"Laurence Llewelyn-Bowen\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":207302,\"name\":\"Chris Moyles\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hvRZoksrBZ4Bhy4tj10RjxhQLhW.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1612018,\"title\":\"Jackass: Best and Last\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tfgccePxnswMqhmtxafliLlcCVR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dUbP1HNdI0aCq1zgRJw28PWSqmk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The fifth and final installment to Jackass franchise where the crew go on one last insane crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":691179,\"title\":\"Friends: The Reunion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bT3c4TSOP8vBmMoXZRDPTII6eDa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qPlAgjG4xy7utjf5L14FZ8kaiWl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The cast of Friends reunites for a once-in-a-lifetime celebration of the hit series, an unforgettable evening filled with iconic memories, uncontrollable laughter, happy tears, and special guests.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12094,\"title\":\"Jackass Number Two\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u73V8dMqUwjtPL6gWesCE7ji9GU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eCP3PAiu442zkJWczdLdvALePNK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jackass Number Two is a compilation of various stunts, pranks and skits, and essentially has no plot. Chris Pontius, Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Bam Margera, and the whole crew return to the screen to raise the stakes higher than ever before.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16290,\"title\":\"Jackass 3D\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uPirN07su7LFixyZyLrNMMQ9u1E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2RmJI0jfXMFF0br3pXQsHiy3lgh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Wee Man and the rest of their fearless and foolhardy friends take part in another round of outrageous pranks and stunts. In addition to standing in the path of a charging bull, launching themselves into the air and crashing through various objects, the guys perform in segments such as \\\"Sweatsuit Cocktail,\\\" \\\"Beehive Tetherball\\\" and \\\"Lamborghini Tooth Pull.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":469019,\"title\":\"Jim & Andy: The Great Beyond - Featuring a Very Special, Contractually Obligated Mention of Tony Clifton\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kKzopOFXz9YfsCTqg3XpF0GoypX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ORjzDMq26GI82COSnJngXm5Kww.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Through the lens of his stunningly immersive performance as Andy Kaufman, Jim Carrey ponders the meaning of life, reality, identity and career.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":656663,\"title\":\"Jackass Forever\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ruHDFumJfW7F2vEqTZEQQ9xT7CA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2J8DpT5bqV0AiI9VVcfiuqKo5l.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Jackass crew, along with some newcomers, returns for one more round of hilarious, absurd, and dangerous stunts.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":273641,\"title\":\"Jackass Presents: Bad Grandpa .5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FBfykfsiFHp3EPlG1rH7S5XwF3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUjVIyeSLL7FxKEvUWPB6oNpbvD.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bad Grandpa .5 gives you a whole new perspective on the world of Irving Zisman with bonus scenes and pranks also featuring Spike Jonze as \\\"Gloria\\\" and Catherine Keener as Irving's wife \\\"Ellie\\\", plus a look at the evolution of Johnny Knoxville's naughty alter-ego, the makeup effects, and a behind-the-scenes peek at the idiocy it takes to make a hidden camera movie in public.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2359,\"title\":\"Sicko\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8PxUhW78Oy4DWZNRyUkKYmhGUaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yvqAedtvpEXsc4SKrHQ7DkRLGMZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary about the corrupt health care system in The United States whose main goal is to make profit even if it means losing people’s lives. \\\"The more people you deny health insurance, the more money we make\\\" is the business model for health care providers in America.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14158,\"title\":\"Jackass 2.5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFCSqC4bjK3Rn6gXHTZGpOUiJ1C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bsU6KKTKhNYWfZNuUkGXWIFZiHe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The crew have now set off to finish what as left over from Jackass 2.0, and in this version they have Wee Man use a 'pee' gun on themselves, having a mini motor bike fracas in the grocery mall, a sperm test, a portly crew member disguised as King Kong, as well as include three episodes of their hilarious adventures in India.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":65851,\"title\":\"Jackass 3.5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o0cILOYbqfppTLAhkI2tzA2BWtX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Am0ZG9RZnnFUWqiMvk0xfYsG6id.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Johnny Knoxville of 'Jackass' releases unused material of stunts, tricks, antics and shenanigans shot during the production of 'Jackass 3D' that didn't make it into the film, as well as the hilarious outtakes.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":828853,\"title\":\"Jackass 4.5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bl686OSeMQOvs90IQAgt8QipCsB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/42975nYxawMHta0yoAtwm6ZPy0L.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Through outrageous, never-before-seen footage, witness the making of the Jackass crew's last go at wild stunts.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1444720,\"title\":\"Shake It Up: Made in Japan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/swmCoSFDSn99Y7Wd9ifJcNZIyOc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yCdNd5CraRGbbPhzBBEnfBAdUKZ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After facing off against crews from across the country in an epic dance battle, Rocky and CeCe win a once-in-a-lifetime trip to Japan to star in a new interactive dance video game. While there, Rocky plans to explore Japan and soak in the culture, but CeCe is convinced that they need to seize the chance to live their dreams and take their shot at becoming real global superstars.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"tSRrsmyYrxY\",\"name\":\"It Started With Swap Shop - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}